    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "For me, it has to be either `exactly same` or `doesn't matter`. If we will introduce more decorators, then they'd better look the same, so that we can do\r\n\r\n```js\r\nwithHits(...\r\n  withLifecycle(...\r\n    withFoo(...\r\n      withBar(...\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt will look cleaner. And ultimately we could do like this:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nwithDecorators([withHits, withLifecycle, ...], ({ container, instantsearch, search }) => {\r\n  ...\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\nbut if we're not going that far, I'm okay with the current signature.",
